<title>USA: Daxor files injection syringe kit 510(k).</title>
<headline>Daxor files injection syringe kit 510(k).</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daxor Corp said it has filed its 510(k) for its quantitative injection syringe kit with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
<p>Daxor said the syringe is desigend to be used in conjunction with its Blood Volume Analyser, which it submitteed for review in November, 1996.</p>
